title: Reach Out to Anakin
subtitle: Someone must reach Anakin Skywalker before Palpatine does.
is-card: true
tags: last_days
card-image: img/card_jedi.svg
view-if: finale and anakin_found and anakin_fall < 9 and ((padme_alive and (padme_married or adv_amidala)) or jedi_relation >= 60 or quigon_alive) and not ld_anakin_used_today
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; ld_anakin_used_today = 1; last_card_timer = ""
new-page: true

= Reach Out to Anakin

Anakin Skywalker is torn between the Jedi, Padmé and Palpatine, who has been his friend since boyhood.

- @do: Reach Out to Anakin.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: anakin_fall -= 1.5 if padme_alive and (padme_married or adv_amidala); anakin_fall -= 0.5 if padme_alive and padme_trust > 0; anakin_fall -= 1 if jedi_relation >= 60 and not (padme_alive and (padme_married or adv_amidala)); anakin_fall -= 0.5 if quigon_alive

[? if padme_alive and (padme_married or adv_amidala) : Padmé tells Anakin everything she knows, and asks him to trust her rather than Palpatine. ?][? if padme_alive and padme_trust > 0 : She has never forgotten that the Caucus kept their secret, and she speaks for us now. ?][? if jedi_relation >= 60 and not (padme_alive and (padme_married or adv_amidala)) : Caucus friends of the Jedi seek Anakin out and speak to him plainly about Palpatine. ?][? if quigon_alive : Qui-Gon Jinn, who found him on Tatooine, sits with him through the night. ?] He does not answer. But he listens.
